{"n":3,"at":"2026-11-11T19:02:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"0000.04","body":"## stood\ntype: why\nsource: [01 / stood]\naxioms: 1.4.6\nwhy: A plan left in chat is not a record, and a model must not start the build before the person has seen the plan.\n\nThis file is the temp workbook for the first design. It was stood on 2026-11-11 after a read of the Workshop root only. No compute exists yet, so the file was written directly. That breaks the rule that only the compute appends. The break is recorded here and the book stays draft.\n\nThe header address is 7. Desk, shelf, and book numbers were not granted, and none were invented. Pages are written in page form until an address is assigned.\n\nBuild is not authorized. There is no pack, no code, and no fixture book."}
