{"n":12,"at":"2026-11-11T19:02:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"0500.04","body":"## door\ntype: why\nsource: [01 / door]\naxioms: 2.5.4\nwhy: A band needs its door before a subject page, or the subject has no place in the thousands it was given.\n\nWhere packs and returns will live. No pack is written in this standing.\n\nThis door is in the temp book only. It is not a kernel page and it does not edit seqAddr or decision A2.6. Pages 0000-0099 stay reserved and are not used as a band."}
