{"n":31,"at":"2026-11-11T19:02:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"0501.01","body":"## held\ntype: rule\naxioms: 5.1\n\nSubject first-build, role jobs. Stood so the dev page has a set. No work is granted."}
{"n":32,"at":"2026-11-11T19:02:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"0501.04","body":"## held\ntype: why\nsource: [01 / held]\naxioms: 5.1.4.8\nwhy: A dev page that names a build, a job, or a trial with nothing at that address is a missing connection. Standing the page is not permission to fill it.\n\nFace 05 has no counters. A pack would be a grant, and this page has no approval to point at. The first pack, if the scope on 0401 is confirmed, would be 0501.05.01 and would stay draft until it lints."}
