{"n":50,"at":"2026-11-11T19:41:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"10.10.10.0502.05.01","body":"by: cursor\nauthorized: person-2026-11-11-next-pages\nlead: M\naxioms: 5.4\noutcome: seqbook read prints one face, and Writer::open appends to an existing book.\noverview: A person names a book file and an address and sees that face's Markdown.\nstop if: The work needs the compute, the Next.js app, or an edit to seqAddr.md or decisions.md.\ngrant: core/src/book.rs, core/src/bin/seqbook.rs, core/tests/next_pages.rs, and appends to cursor/temp.book.\nframe: read\nrisk: 2\npredecessor: 10.10.10.0401\n\n## w01\ntype: work\ntitle: Open an existing book and append\naxioms: 6\nreason: These pages have to be written by the writer, or the core grows a second way to append.\npath: core/src/book.rs\n\n## w02\ntype: work\ntitle: Print one face\naxioms: 5.4\nreason: The timer why has to be readable as the face, not as a JSON line.\npath: core/src/bin/seqbook.rs\n","tail":"draft"}
{"n":51,"at":"2026-11-11T19:41:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"10.10.10.0403.00","body":"address: 0403\ntitle: why-check\nstate: draft\ntype: workflow\naxioms: 5\nband: dev\nthousands: 0\nmvp: why-check\n"}
{"n":52,"at":"2026-11-11T19:41:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"10.10.10.0403.01","body":"## frame\ntype: rule\naxioms: 5\n\nMVP: reject a 01 or 02 card that has no 04 card with the same key, a why line, and a body.\n\nDone: the timer fixture passes, and a page whose purpose card has no 04 twin fails the check. A 04 body that copies the 01 body is a finding, not a failure.\n"}
{"n":53,"at":"2026-11-11T19:41:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"10.10.10.0403.04","body":"## frame\ntype: why\nsource: [01 / frame]\naxioms: 4.5\nwhy: The why is the part that has to survive after the recipe rots, so a missing why is not a style nit.\n\nC3.2 already calls the missing twin, the missing why line, and the missing body a hard refusal. This page puts that rule in the core as a check a person can run. It does not decide the open keyword rule, and it does not turn the check into the compute.\n"}
{"n":54,"at":"2026-11-11T19:41:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"10.10.10.0403.08","body":"## frame\ntype: link\naxioms: 8.7\nkind: 7\nwhy: The set is written both ways. Link kinds are not settled.\n\nDev 0403.why-check. Build 0303.why-check . Jobs 0503.why-check.\n"}
