{"n":58,"at":"2026-11-11T19:41:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"10.10.10.0503.08","body":"## frame\ntype: link\naxioms: 8.7\nkind: 7\nwhy: The jobs page points back at the dev page it packs.\n\nDev page: 0403.why-check.\n"}
{"n":59,"at":"2026-11-11T19:41:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"10.10.10.0503.05.01","body":"by: cursor\nauthorized: person-2026-11-11-next-pages\nlead: M\naxioms: 4.5\noutcome: seqbook check fails a 01 card with no 04 why, and the timer fixture passes.\noverview: The why rule from C3.2 runs against a book file.\nstop if: The work needs the compute, keyword branding, or an edit to decisions.md.\ngrant: core/src/check.rs, core/src/bin/seqbook.rs, core/tests/next_pages.rs, and appends to cursor/temp.book.\nframe: why-check\nrisk: 2\npredecessor: 10.10.10.0402\n\n## w01\ntype: work\ntitle: Check the why rule\naxioms: 4\nreason: A fixture that happens to contain a why is not the same as a check that refuses a missing one.\npath: core/src/check.rs\n","tail":"draft"}
{"n":60,"at":"2026-11-11T19:41:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"10.10.10.0404.00","body":"address: 0404\ntitle: page-shape\nstate: draft\ntype: workflow\naxioms: 5\nband: dev\nthousands: 0\nmvp: page-shape\n"}
{"n":61,"at":"2026-11-11T19:41:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"10.10.10.0404.01","body":"## frame\ntype: rule\naxioms: 5\n\nMVP: reject a page that has faces but no face 00, or no content face in 01-06 or 08.\n\nDone: the timer fixture passes. A page with only face 07 fails. A page with only face 01 fails because face 00 is missing.\n"}
{"n":62,"at":"2026-11-11T19:41:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"10.10.10.0404.04","body":"## frame\ntype: why\nsource: [01 / frame]\naxioms: 4.5\nwhy: A page with no stamp, or a stamp with nothing a person or a model can read, is not a page yet.\n\nC1 says a page needs face 00 and at least one of 01-06 or 08. Face 07 does not count. This check makes that visible before a later compute refuses the write. Draft faces count, because a page is allowed to start as a draft.\n"}
{"n":63,"at":"2026-11-11T19:41:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"10.10.10.0404.08","body":"## frame\ntype: link\naxioms: 8.7\nkind: 7\nwhy: The set is written both ways. Link kinds are not settled.\n\nDev 0404.page-shape. Build 0304.page-shape . Jobs 0504.page-shape.\n"}
