{"n":96,"at":"2026-11-11T19:55:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"10.10.10.0503.06.01","body":"## ran\ntype: note\naxioms: 5.6.9\nby: cursor\nrefs: 10.10.10.0503.05.01\nclaim: 52a68f1b-6495-457b-b16d-84c7c0ac6f3f\nwhy: The pack was draft, and the page now has an AGENTS.md, so the run has a place to be recorded.\n\nBuilder read cursor/pages/10.10.10.0503/AGENTS.md and ran the pack.\n\n## w01\nresult: done\ncommand: cargo test --test next_pages -- missing_why_is_a_hard_gap copied_why_is_a_finding timer_fixture_passes_both_checks\nevidence: test result: ok. 3 passed; 0 failed.\n\n## notes\nnone. Why: the three tests passed on the check already in core/, and nothing was edited.\n\n## unprompted\nOne cargo run per test name. Why: the first form of the ask was not a command cargo accepts.\n\n## overflow\nThe tests call why_gaps in process. They do not run seqbook check. Keyword branding stayed untouched. Why: both sit outside the ask, and keyword branding is a stop.\n\nLint finding: the work card has no ask line. The page AGENTS.md held the ask. The person ordered this drafted pack to run, so the tail moved. This note is the return. It is not a review, and the tail stops at return.\n"}
