{"n":100,"at":"2026-11-11T19:55:00Z","by":"cursor","op":"put","addr":"10.10.10.0504.06.01","body":"## ran\ntype: note\naxioms: 5.6.9\nby: cursor\nrefs: 10.10.10.0504.05.01\nclaim: f13de36c-7b36-4084-aa10-64ab5e38f63e\nwhy: The pack was draft, and the page now has an AGENTS.md, so the run has a place to be recorded.\n\nBuilder read cursor/pages/10.10.10.0504/AGENTS.md. The first ask was not a command cargo accepts, so the page ask was corrected and the pack was run again.\n\n## w01\nresult: done\ncommand: cargo test --test next_pages -- page_shape_rejects_a_stamp_with_only_face_07 timer_fixture_passes_both_checks\nevidence: test result: ok. 2 passed; 0 failed.\n\n## notes\nNo file in the grant was edited. Why: both named tests passed.\n\n## unprompted\nAlso run seqbook check on a page of only face 07 and a page with no face 00. Why: the pack outcome names seqbook check, and these tests call page_gaps in process. That extra command was not part of the ask, so it was not run.\n\n## overflow\nFive other tests in next_pages were filtered out. Why: they were not on this ask.\n\nLint finding: the work card has no ask line. The page AGENTS.md held the ask. The person ordered this drafted pack to run, so the tail moved. This note is the return. It is not a review, and the tail stops at return.\n"}
